  "Configuration and help": "設定與說明",
  "Open the shield control beneath the message box. Its tooltip is **Permissions**.": "開啟訊息輸入框下方的盾牌圖示控制項，其工具提示為**權限**。",
  "The shield and Full access label identify this chat's permission control.": "盾牌圖示與「完整存取」標籤標示了此聊天的權限控制項。",
  "Review your task and submit it.": "檢查任務內容並送出。",
  "Open http://localhost:3000/settings in Dream's browser. Change the theme, refresh the page, and check whether the selection persists. Inspect the console and network requests if it fails.": "在 Dream 的瀏覽器中開啟 http://localhost:3000/settings。變更主題，重新整理頁面，然後檢查所選主題是否保留。如果沒有保留，請檢查主控台和網路請求。",
  "Find why the settings form loses its values after a refresh. Fix the cause and explain how you verified the fix.": "找出重新整理頁面後設定表單遺失數值的原因。修正問題，並說明你如何驗證修正結果。",
  "Review the current changes for bugs, missing edge cases, and unintended behavior. Report findings with file references. Do not edit files yet.": "檢查目前變更中的錯誤、遺漏的邊界情況和非預期行為。報告發現的問題，並附上檔案參照。暫時不要編輯檔案。",
  "Dream's [built-in browser tools](/docs/browser#ask-an-agent-to-use-the-browser) are connected automatically for supported providers; you do not need to add a server for them here.": "Dream 的[內建瀏覽器工具](/docs/browser#ask-an-agent-to-use-the-browser)會為支援的供應商自動連線，無需在此處為它們新增伺服器。",
  "[Skills](/docs/skills) are available for Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, and Cursor. [MCP servers](/docs/mcp-servers) and Dream's built-in browser tools are available for Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, and Grok Build; Cursor does not support these Dream-managed tool connections.": "[技能](/docs/skills)適用於 Claude Code、Codex、OpenCode 和 Cursor。[MCP 伺服器](/docs/mcp-servers)和 Dream 的內建瀏覽器工具適用於 Claude Code、Codex、OpenCode 和 Grok Build；Cursor 不支援這些由 Dream 管理的工具連線。",
  "Choose a unique **Name** using letters, numbers, dashes, and underscores, beginning with a letter or number.": "選擇一個唯一的**名稱**，可使用字母、數字、連字號和底線，並以字母或數字開頭。",
  "Executable in **Command**, one argument per line in **Arguments**, and optional **Environment variables**": "在**命令**中填寫執行檔，在**引數**中每行填寫一個引數，並視需要填寫**環境變數**",
  "An HTTP or HTTPS **URL** and optional **Headers**": "HTTP 或 HTTPS **URL**，以及選填的**標頭**",
  "Enter a short **Name** that you will recognize in the chat menu.": "輸入一個簡短的**名稱**，以便在聊天選單中辨識。",
  "The selected provider determines the exact permission behavior. **Ask** does not mean every read or tool call prompts, and **Accept edits** does not approve every command.": "具體的權限行為由所選供應商決定。**詢問**並不表示每次讀取或工具呼叫都會要求核准，**接受編輯**也不表示核准所有命令。",
  "Dream no longer has separate Build and Plan controls. To plan first, ask the agent to investigate and propose an approach before making changes. That instruction is not a read-only filesystem boundary; choose permissions appropriate to the task as well.": "Dream 不再提供獨立的 Build 和 Plan 控制項。如果希望先擬定計畫，請讓代理在進行變更前調查問題並提出方案。這項指示不會將檔案系統存取限制為唯讀；還應為任務選擇適當的權限。",
  "If the request requires changing the task, give the agent the revised instruction in that chat. Use the stop control to interrupt a response when necessary. Stopping does not roll back edits or commands that already completed; inspect [Changes](/docs/git-workflows) afterward, or use the reply's [checkpoint](/docs/checkpoints) to restore files it changed.": "如果需要調整任務，請在該聊天中向代理提供修改後的指示。必要時使用停止控制項中斷回應。停止不會復原已完成的編輯或命令；之後請檢查[變更](/docs/git-workflows)，或使用該回應的[檢查點](/docs/checkpoints)還原它修改的檔案。",
  "Loading page…": "正在載入頁面…",
  "Permalink to {heading}": "前往{heading}的永久連結",
  "Search results": "搜尋結果",
  "New chats inherit **Default permissions** from Settings. Open the shield control below the message box and choose **Ask**, **Accept edits**, or **Full access** for this task. See [Agent permissions](/docs/agent-modes).": "新聊天會繼承設定中的**預設權限**。開啟訊息框下方的盾牌圖示控制項，為此任務選擇**詢問**、**接受編輯**或**完整存取**。請參閱[代理權限](/docs/agent-modes)。",
  "Dream takes the **before** snapshot once per message you send, and the **after** snapshot when the response finishes or when you stop it.": "你每傳送一則訊息，Dream 都會記錄一次**修改前**的快照，並在回應完成或你停止回應時記錄**修改後**的快照。",
  "Restore is a file operation, not a Git operation. Open [Changes](/docs/git-workflows) afterward to review the working tree, and [save any editor drafts](/docs/files) before restoring the same files.": "還原屬於檔案操作，而非 Git 操作。還原後請開啟[變更](/docs/git-workflows)檢查工作樹，並在還原同一檔案之前[儲存編輯器中的草稿](/docs/files)。"
}
